If ever your mother fell over the power cable when you were playing that
AC -18 caveman wielding the Vorpal Blade, you would even be more
convinced that backups are necessary. But what I wanted to say was
that playing with save/restore is just no fun, a bit like playing in
wizard mode or finding a wand of wishing (3) on the second level (That
really happened to me once). I even hate it when I have to restore
because of a power failure or a crash, because it's never like the first
time again. But saving can be necessary.

Another thing: what about making a backup and quitting to see your
intrinsics ? Some people do so, but aren't there potions for that ? 
I find it takes the suspense away if you look at your intrinsics this
way before you eat that quantummechanic corpse.

